description: "GeoGuessr for Mindustry! Drops you onto a random campaign sector in crisp GPU-baked HD terrain view, then challenges you to pinpoint its exact hex on the 3D planet globe. Supports Serpulo, Erekir, procedural sectors, Move/No-Move/NMPZ modes, and Hide Buildings."
